OL,3,GNEWSAThe Irish international rugby
OL,4,A'trailblazer' and her legacy of cancer
OL,5,Aawareness
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey gathered to remember "a girl like
OL,8,Fno other" - a trailblazing rugby player
OL,9,Fwhose exploits on the pitch were
OL,10,Fcruelly cut short by her death at just
OL,11,F33.
OL,13,FLast Saturday, on a sunny September
OL,14,Fafternoon two teams from two different
OL,15,Fcorners of Northern Ireland came to
OL,16,FCity of Derry to contest the Rosie
OL,17,FStewart Memorial Bowl.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
