OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThe Irish international rugby
OL,4,A'trailblazer' and her legacy of cancer
OL,5,Aawareness
OL,6,
OL,7,FStewart, from Londonderry, won four
OL,8,Fcaps for Ireland between 1999 and 2000
OL,9,Fand was a founding member of Ulster
OL,10,FWomen's Rugby but, in 2003, she died
OL,11,Fafter being diagnosed with breast
OL,12,Fcancer.
OL,14,FThe memorial match is held every year
OL,15,Fin her memory and also to promote
OL,16,Ffemale health, a cause her sister
OL,17,FColette Risely said would have been
OL,18,Fclose to Stewart's heart.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
